    {
      "id": "p0182-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undyne offers the main character a drink. Options include tea, hot chocolate, soda, and a cup of sugar. If the player selects the cup of sugar, Undyne says in English:",
        "raw": "Undyne offers the main character a drink. Options include tea, hot chocolate, soda,\nand a cup of sugar. If the player selects the cup of sugar, Undyne says in English:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29538225,
          0.22707857,
          0.90230301,
          0.25808571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2877325,
          0.22636429,
          0.90995275,
          0.25915714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undyne 请主角喝点东西，可选茶、热巧克力、汽水和一杯糖。如果选那杯糖，英语版中 Undyne 会说：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
