    {
      "id": "p0182-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "I'm not gonna give you a cup ofs ugar! What do I look like, the ice-cream woman? Do human ice-cream women TERRORIZE HUMANITY with ENERGY SPEARS? Are their ice-cream songs a PRELUDE TO DESTRUCTION?",
        "raw": "I'm not gonna give you a cup ofs ugar! What do I look like, the ice-cream\nwoman? Do human ice-cream women TERRORIZE HUMANITY\nwith ENERGY SPEARS? Are their ice-cream songs a PRELUDE TO\nDESTRUCTION?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.33936319,
          0.27332857,
          0.87964956,
          0.34027143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.33803724,
          0.27261429,
          0.88097551,
          0.34134286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          14,
          15
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我才不会给你一杯糖！你当我是卖冰淇淋的女人吗？人类世界卖冰淇淋的女人，会用能量长矛让全人类闻风丧胆吗？她们的冰淇淋歌，是毁灭的序曲吗？",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
