    {
      "id": "p0182-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The joke here is part of a larger running gag: Undyne imagines the human world to be just like what's depicted in fiction-based anime and manga. And in this scene, she equates happy ice cream truck music with a human warrior's \"death to the enemy\" song.",
        "raw": "The joke here is part of a larger running gag: Undyne imagines the human\nworld to be just like what's depicted in fiction-based anime and manga. And in\nthis scene, she equates happy ice cream truck music with a human warrior's\n\"death to the enemy\" song.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28977243,
          0.35577143,
          0.89848833,
          0.42117143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2877325,
          0.35505714,
          0.90995275,
          0.42224286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          16,
          17,
          18,
          19
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这处笑料延续了游戏里反复出现的一个梗：Undyne 以为，人类世界就像虚构的动画和漫画描绘的那样。因此在这里，她把冰淇淋车欢快的音乐，当成了人类战士的“消灭敌人”之歌。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29585143,
          0.35434286,
          0.90791282,
          0.42474286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.9242857142857143,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
        "gap_before": 12,
        "flow_after": "p0182-b004"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29585143,
          0.35434286,
          0.90791282,
          0.42474286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0182-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although ice cream trucks represent a commonly shared cultural experience in many Western countries, they're culturally insignificant in Japan. This left the localization team in a tough situation: Undyne's line needs to be related to sugar, a literal translation wouldn't make much sense, and there's no strong equivalent to musical ice cream trucks in Japanese culture. For this reason, early drafts of the Japanese scripts had Undyne talk about how warriors in the human world surely sell ice cream and work in ice cream shops.",
        "raw": "Although ice cream trucks represent a commonly shared cultural experience\nin many Western countries, they're culturally insignificant in Japan. This left\nthe localization team in a tough situation: Undyne's line needs to be related\nto sugar, a literal translation wouldn't make much sense, and there's no strong\nequivalent to musical ice cream trucks in Japanese culture. For this reason,\nearly drafts of the Japanese scripts had Undyne talk about how warriors in the\nhuman world surely sell ice cream and work in ice cream shops.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29440308,
          0.43662857,
          0.89924311,
          0.55897857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2877325,
          0.43591429,
          0.90995275,
          0.56005
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "冰淇淋车在许多西方国家是共同的文化记忆，在日本却没什么文化分量。这给本地化团队出了难题：Undyne 的台词必须与糖有关，直译说不通，日本文化里也找不到足以对应音乐冰淇淋车的事物。因此，日文剧本的早期译稿让 Undyne 说，人类世界的战士一定会卖冰淇淋、在冰淇淋店工作。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29585143,
          0.4352,
          0.90791282,
          0.56255
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
