    {
      "id": "p0182-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Later, a localization team member noted that Undyne's new line felt too plain in comparison to the original. The line was then updated to suggest that human warriors surely eat ice cream before charging into battle.",
        "raw": "Later, a localization team member noted that Undyne's new line felt too plain\nin comparison to the original. The line was then updated to suggest that\nhuman warriors surely eat ice cream before charging into battle.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29722839,
          0.57411429,
          0.89173616,
          0.62297857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2877325,
          0.5734,
          0.90995275,
          0.62405
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          27,
          28,
          29
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "后来，一位团队成员觉得，新台词与原文相比太平淡，于是又改成了人类战士一定会在冲上战场前吃冰淇淋。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
