      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "After even more discussion, the translator changed Undyne's line to reference a classic Japanese snack instead of ice cream trucks:",
        "raw": "After even more discussion, the translator changed Undyne's line to reference a\nclassic Japanese snack instead of ice cream trucks:",
        "status": "corrected",
