    {
      "id": "p0182-b010",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Who the hell pours sugar into a cup and offers it to a guest?! What, do you plan on sipping it with a spoon or something? I mean, I've heard ofp eople with a sweet-tooth before, but this is on a different level. Or do sweets on the surface world make you strong, let you sprint for 300 meters, and other stuff like that?",
        "raw": "Who the hell pours sugar into a cup and offers it to a guest?! What, do you\nplan on sipping it with a spoon or something? I mean, I've heard ofp eople\nwith a sweet-tooth before, but this is on a different level. Or do sweets on\nthe surface world make you strong, let you sprint for 300 meters, and other\nstuff like that?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
